    <!-- CR3-FINAL round 3, item 6: Configuration → "Pending Approvals" menu
         DELETED. It listed account.move records with
         way4tech_approval_state='pending' — the old >500 SAR journal-entry
         approval, a different mechanism from the Part A manpower approvals,
         and always empty here. Three approval-ish menus, two of them empty,
         made it unclear where approvals actually live: Manpower → Approvals.
         The menuitem is removed from this file rather than deactivated —
         Odoo drops data records that disappear from a module's files on
         upgrade, and a <record> here would break a fresh install because
         nothing would create the menu first. The action and its views are
         kept, so the list stays reachable by direct link. -->

